# Overhaust configuration
# OVERHAUST_DB_PATH - override default SQLite location (default: <project>/data/overhaust_memory.db)
# OVERHAUST_API_HOST - API bind host (default: 0.0.0.0)
# OVERHAUST_API_PORT - API server port (default: 8000)
# OVERHAUST_API_BASE_URL - client URL for demos/API connection (default: http://localhost:8000)
# OVERHAUST_ALLOWED_ORIGINS - comma-separated CORS origins (default: localhost dev ports)
# OVERHAUST_DEFAULT_MODEL - token estimation model (default: gpt-4)
# OVERHAUST_EMBEDDINGS - enable hybrid semantic retrieval (0=off default, 1=on)
# OVERHAUST_EMBEDDING_MODEL - fastembed model id (default: BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5)
# OVERHAUST_HYBRID_KEYWORD_WEIGHT - hybrid fusion weight (default: 0.55)
# OVERHAUST_HYBRID_SEMANTIC_WEIGHT - hybrid fusion weight (default: 0.40)
# OVERHAUST_HYBRID_FRESHNESS_WEIGHT - hybrid fusion weight (default: 0.05)
# OVERHAUST_TRUST_MIN - minimum trust threshold for filtering (default: 0.3)
# OVERHAUST_FLOW_MAX_STEPS - max steps in code-flow evidence path (default: 6)
# OVERHAUST_FLOW_BEAM_WIDTH - partial paths kept during beam search (default: 4)
# OVERHAUST_FLOW_SEED_SEARCH_LIMIT - index hits for code-flow seed pool (default: 36)
# OVERHAUST_FLOW_MIN_RELEVANCE - stop flow expansion below this score 0-1 (default: 0.12)
# OVERHAUST_FLOW_READ_CALLS - detect call edges from source files (1=on default, 0=off)
# OVERHAUST_INDEX_WEAK_KW_THRESHOLD - raw keyword score below which hybrid favors semantic (default: 2.5)
# OVERHAUST_INDEX_GENERIC_PENALTY - multiplier for generic symbol/path hits (default: 0.15)
